abstract: "A codebase for training, evaluating, fine-tuning, and pruning a roughly 0.2B parameter encoder-only Chinese small language model with H20 multi-GPU recipes, public Chinese data preparation, SCENIC-style SFT and contrastive SFT, C-Eval evaluation, and sparsity benchmarking utilities."
